          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} to ask about sound baths, private sessions, or group bookings in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg1:#0f1724;--bg2:#081021;--accent:#9ae6b4;--muted:#b8c6d1;--card:#0b1220;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial; background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));color:#e6f0f2}\\n    .wrap{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\\n    header{position:relative;padding:36px 24px 12px;z-index:6}\\n    .nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(154,230,180,0.16), rgba(173,153,255,0.08));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);font-size:18px}\\n    nav>a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}\\n    nav>a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:#fff}\\n    /* Hero */\\n    .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:56px 24px 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}\\n    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:28px;border-radius:14px;backdrop-filter: blur(6px);box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-size:28px;color:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#e6f0f2)}\\n    .sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    .pill{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    /* Pattern SVG */\\n    .pattern-veil{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.14}\\n    /* Form */\\n    form.card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:#fff}\\n    input::placeholder,textarea::placeholder{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35)}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    button.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#b7a7ff);border:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;color:#052018;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    footer{padding:30px 24px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}\\n    /* Sections */\\n    section{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px 24px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .card-soft{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.015), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}\\n    .case{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .quote{font-style:italic;color:var(--muted)}\\n    /* FAQ */\\n    details{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}\\n    summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}\\n    /* Responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:40px}.grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-card{order:2}}    \\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <nav>\\n          <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Sanctuary</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Gather</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">The Practice</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">Help</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#b7a7ff);color:#032218;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Reach</a>\\n        </nav>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"pattern-veil\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1200 600\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n            <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#2b536b\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/>\\n            <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#5d3ea8\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/>\\n          </linearGradient>\\n          <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(12)\\\">\\n            <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"10\\\" cy=\\\"10\\\" r=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"#9ae6b4\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\" />\\n            <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"60\\\" r=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"#b7a7ff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.08\\\" />\\n            <path d=\\\"M0 120 L120 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#8aa6b9\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.04\\\"/>\\n          </pattern>\\n        </defs>\\n        <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" />\\n      </svg>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <h1>Reach the sound studio at {{VENUE_NAME}}</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"sub\\\">A gentle, sensory approach to group and private sound experiences. Connect with scheduling, accessibility, and facilitation questions.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Lead: {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Next Event: {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">City: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"card-soft\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">How we respond</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"quote\\\" style=\\\"margin:0\\\">We typically reply within 48 hours. For urgent booking changes, call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"card-soft\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Visit & privacy</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Messages may include appointment specifics. We respect your privacy — contact only for booking and event updates unless you opt into our list.</p>\\n        </section>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"hero-card\\\" style=\\\"align-self:start\\\">\\n        <form class=\\\"card\\\" id=\\\"contactForm\\\" action=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" enctype=\\\"text/plain\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"First & last\\\" required>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\" required>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"width:120px\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"topic\\\">Reason</label>\\n              <select id=\\\"topic\\\" name=\\\"topic\\\">\\n                <option>Ask about an event</option>\\n                <option>Private session</option>\\n                <option>Book the venue</option>\\n                <option>Other</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"msg\\\">Message / details</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"msg\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us about accessibility needs, group size, desired dates...\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:6px\\\">\\n            <small style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Prefer booking? Use <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">Reserve</a>.</small>\\n            <button class=\\\"primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send inquiry</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <strong>Hours:</strong> by appointment & select events. Walk-ins not guaranteed.<br>\\n          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- myth vs truth -->\\n    <section>\\n      <div class=\\\"card-soft\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Myths & truths about sound baths</h2>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);border-radius:10px\\\">\\n            <strong>Myth</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"quote\\\">Sound baths are only for deeply spiritual people.</p>\\n            <strong>Truth</strong>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">They are accessible sensory practices — helpful for stress, sleep, and focus for many backgrounds.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);border-radius:10px\\\">\\n            <strong>Myth</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"quote\\\">You must do something specific to \\\"receive\\\" a sound bath.</p>\\n            <strong>Truth</strong>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">No technique required — rest, breathe, and allow sound to be the attention anchor.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);border-radius:10px\\\">\\n            <strong>Myth</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"quote\\\">Effects are immediate and permanent.</p>\\n            <strong>Truth</strong>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Many people notice immediate calm; repeated practice supports integration over time.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- pillars -->\\n    <section>\\n      <div class=\\\"card-soft\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Our pillars — how we design sessions</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);border-radius:10px\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Safety & consent</h4>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Clear guidance, optional movement, and pre-session intake for any sensitivities.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);border-radius:10px\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Sensory architecture</h4>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">A curated progression of timbre and space using instruments like crystal bowls, tuned chimes, and the monochord to shape immersion.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);border-radius:10px\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Integration</h4>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Gentle closing cues, optional journaling prompts, and resources to carry the calm into daily life.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- case notes -->\\n    <section>\\n      <div class=\\\"card-soft\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Case notes & session flow</h2>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(154,230,180,0.06);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)\\\">A</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <strong>Short course flow</strong>\\n              <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Arrival & grounding (10m) — breathwork & intention (10m) — sound immersion (35-45m) using crystal bowls and soft tuning forks — gentle closing & reflection (10m).</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(183,167,255,0.04);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#b7a7ff\\\">C</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <strong>Private & focused sessions</strong>\\n              <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">1:1 journeys include intake, intention mapping, and targeted sound using gong, tuning forks, or monochord depending on goals. Typical length: 60–90 min.</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(139,197,186,0.04);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#8bd6be\\\">G</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <strong>What to bring</strong>\\n              <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">A yoga mat, pillow or bolster, blanket for warmth, water bottle, and an open curiosity. We provide extra blankets and eye-pillows on request.</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ & contraindications -->\\n    <section>\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Frequently asked</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card-soft\\\">\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Is a sound bath safe during pregnancy?</summary>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Many pregnant people attend with facilitator approval. We recommend checking with your care provider if you have concerns. We offer lower-intensity options and seating if needed.</div>\\n          </details>\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Do I need experience?</summary>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">No. Sessions are guided for first timers and repeat attendees alike. Rest, notice, and breathe.</div>\\n          </details>\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Are sound baths therapeutic / medical?</summary>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Our work is somatic and supportive but not a substitute for medical or psychiatric care. If you have a history of seizures, epilepsy, or severe psychiatric conditions, consult your clinician before attending and inform the facilitator.</div>\\n          </details>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card-soft\\\">\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Contraindications & safety notes</summary>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">High-volume exposure is avoided. If you have a pacemaker, tinnitus, pregnancy complications, recent surgery, or are on heavy medication, complete the intake form and check with your provider. We offer quiet seats and distance from instruments.</div>\\n          </details>\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>What instruments are used?</summary>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">We rotate instruments: crystal bowls, gong, chimes, tuning forks, and the monochord. Instrument choice adapts to the session intention.</div>\\n          </details>\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>How to prepare</summary>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Avoid heavy meals right before. Hydrate, wear comfortable layers, and arrive 10–15 minutes early to settle. Bring what helps you rest for 60–90 minutes.</div>\\n          </details>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CTA -->\\n    <section>\\n      <div class=\\\"card-soft\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Ready to reserve a spot or ask a question?</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Use the form, call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>, or press the button to go to booking.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#b7a7ff);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;color:#031f1a;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\">Reserve with {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Email us</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px 24px\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // Small progressive enhancement: show a confirmation on submit\\n    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){\\n      // let the mailto fallback work; show a small visual confirmation\\n      alert('Thanks — your message will be sent to {{EMAIL}}. We aim to reply within 48 hours.');\\n    });\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# contact.html — Sound Bath Events (sound_bath)\\n\\nThis chunk contains the contact page for a small, sensory-forward sound bath studio. Use the placeholders below to inject business-specific data when deploying.\\n\\nPlaceholders (do not remove):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}\\n- {{VENUE_NAME}}\\n- {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Layout family: clinic_modern; voice: mystic_modern.\\n- Includes required sections: hero, myth_vs_truth, pillars, case_notes, faq, cta.\\n- Sensory & safety content included: \\\"what to bring\\\", contraindications disclaimer, and a clear session flow.\\n- Instruments referenced vary (crystal bowls, tuning forks, chimes, gong, monochord) to satisfy uniqueness.\\n- No external assets referenced — the page uses an inline SVG pattern and CSS gradients for visual richness.\\n\\nFiles in this bundle:\\n- contact.html — the contact page HTML.\\n\\nSeed: 311619414\\nSlug: sound_bath-2026-02-16T14-22-29-003Z-044\\nLayout family: clinic_modern\\nVoice family: mystic_modern\\nOffer model: retail_addon\\n\\nUsage:\\n- Replace placeholders with your environment variables or templating engine.\\n- Link this page from the site nav (nav labels intentionally varied: \\\"Sanctuary, Gather, Private, Investment, The Practice, Help, Reserve, Reach\\\").\\n\\nNotes:\\n- This chunk intentionally keeps imagery local (inline SVG) and focuses on accessible, clear content for contact and pre-visit guidance.\\n- If you need a separate assets/img/pattern.svg file, extract the <pattern> definition from contact.html and save as an SVG file; the page will function without external assets.\\n\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
